{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43322","headline":"玉壶冰 · 钱衆仲","name":"玉壶冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬律初阴结，寒冰贮玉壶。\n霜姿虽异禀，虹气亦相符。\n对月光宜竝，临池影不孤。\n贞坚方共济，同处岂殊途。\n色莹连城璧，形分照乘珠。\n提携今在此，抱素节宁渝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱衆仲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}